### Login as admin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "root_admin@t.co",
  "password": "Password1234!",
  "userRole": "admin"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminAccessToken", response.body.data.token.accessToken);
%}

### List every user (admin only)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### List users filtered by role
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users?role=gallery
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Read a single user by user id
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Delete a user (blocked while the user still owns domain data)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}

### Change my own password (any authenticated user)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/v1/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Password1234!",
  "newPassword": "NewPassword1234!"
}

### Logout (revoke my active refresh tokens)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminAccessToken}}
